#. Tag: title
#: functions.docbook:3582
#, no-c-format
msgid "FV_ANNUITY"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3583
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The FV_ANNUITY() function returns the future value of a stream of payments "
"given the amount of the payment, the interest rate and the number of "
"periods. For example: If you receive $500 per year for 20 years, and invest "
"it at 8%, the total after 20 years will be FV_annuity(500;0.08;20) or "
"$22,880.98. This function assumes that payments are made at the end of each "
"period."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon FV_ANNUITY() gifft den tokamen Weert vun en fast Geldstroom "
"torüch, angeven dör de Betahlen, den Tinssatz un de Tall vun Perioden. Wenn "
"Een a.B. twintig Johr lang 500 Dollar in't Johr kriggt un se mit 8% Tinsen "
"anleggt, gifft dat na 20 Johren tosamen en FV_annuity(500;0.08;20) oder "
"22880,98 Dollar. Disse Funkschoon vermoodt de Utbetahlen an't Enn vun elk "
"Periood."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3588
#, no-c-format
msgid "FV_ANNUITY(amount;interest;periods)"
msgstr "FV_ANNUITY(Bedrag; Tins;Perioden)"

#. Tag: seg
#: functions.docbook:3592 functions.docbook:4077
#, no-c-format
msgid "Payment per period"
msgstr "Utbetahlen per Periood"

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3597
#, no-c-format
msgid "FV_ANNUITY(1000;0.05;5) equals 5525.63"
msgstr "FV_ANNUITY(1000;0,05;5) gifft \"5525,63\" torüch"

#. Tag: title
#: functions.docbook:3603
#, no-c-format
msgid "INTRATE"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3604
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The INTRATE function returns the interest rate for a fully invested "
"security. Basis is the type of day counting you want to use: 0: US 30/360 "
"(default), 1: real days, 2: real days/360, 3: real days/365 or 4: European "
"30/365."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon INTRATE gifft den Tins för en vull anleggt Weertpapeer torüch. "
"Basis is de Oort, wodennig de Daag tellt warrt: 0 = amerikaansch 30/360 "
"(Standard), 1 = reaal Daag, 2 = reaal Daag/360, 3 = reaal Daag/365 oder 4 = "
"europääsch 30/365."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3609
#, no-c-format
msgid "INTRATE(settlement; maturity; investment; redemption; basis)"
msgstr "INTRATE(Utbetahldatum; Afloopdatum; Investitschoon; Inlösen; Basis)"

#. Tag: seg
#: functions.docbook:3615 functions.docbook:3784 functions.docbook:4124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Investment"
msgstr "Utgaav"

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3620
#, no-c-format
msgid "INTRATE(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 1000000; 2000000; 1) returns 1.98"
msgstr ""
"INTRATE(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 1000000; 2000000; 1) gifft \"1.98\" "
"torüch."

#. Tag: title
#: functions.docbook:3626
#, no-c-format
msgid "IPMT"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3627
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"IPMT calculates the amount of a payment of an annuity going towards interest."
msgstr "PPMT reekt den Utbetahlbedrag för en Rent vun en Tinstahlen ut."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3628 functions.docbook:3688 functions.docbook:3981
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rate is the periodic interest rate."
msgstr "Tins is de perioodsch Tinssatz."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3629 functions.docbook:3982
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Period is the amortizement period. 1 for the first and NPER for the last "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Periood is de Tilgenperiood. \"1\" för de eerste un \"NPER\" för de leste "
"Periood."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3630 functions.docbook:3983
#, no-c-format
msgid "NPER is the total number of periods during which annuity is paid."
msgstr "NPER sünd all Perioden wielt de en Rent betahlt warrt."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3631 functions.docbook:3691 functions.docbook:3984
#, no-c-format
msgid "PV is the present value in the sequence of payments."
msgstr "PV is de aktuell Weert binnen en Reeg vun Betahlen."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3632 functions.docbook:3985
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "FV (optional) is the desired (future) value.  default: 0."
msgid "FV (optional) is the desired (future) value. default: 0."
msgstr "FV (optschonaal) is de verwacht (tokamen) Weert. Standard: 0."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3633 functions.docbook:3986
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type (optional) defines the due date. 1 for payment at the beginning of a "
"period and 0 (default) for payment at the end of a period."
msgstr ""
"Typ (optschonaal) leggt de Duer fast: 1 för Betahlen an'n Anfang vun en "
"Periood, un 0 (Standard) för Betahlen an't Enn vun de Periood."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3634
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The example shows the interest to pay in the last year of a three year loan. "
"The interest rate is 10 percent."
msgstr ""
"Dat Bispill wiest de Tinsen, de in't leste Johr för en Kredit mit dree "
"Johren Looptiet betahlt warrn mööt. De Tinssatz is 10 Perzent."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:3639
#, no-c-format
msgid "IPMT(Rate; Period; NPer; PV; FV; Type)"
msgstr "IPMT(Tins; Periood; NPer; PV; FV; Typ)"

