#. Tag: title
#: functions.docbook:9317
#, no-c-format
msgid "ZTEST"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:9318
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The ZTEST() function calculates the two tailed probability of a z-test with "
"normal distribution."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ZTEST() reekt de twee tweesiedig Wohrschienlichkeit vun en z-"
"Test mit normaal Verdelen ut."

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:9319
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Performs a test of the null hypothesis, that sample is a sample\n"
#| "            of a normal distributed random variable with mean mean and "
#| "standard\n"
#| "            deviation sigma. A return value of 1 indicates, that the "
#| "null\n"
#| "            hypothesis is rejected, i.e. the sample is not a random "
#| "sample of\n"
#| "            the normal distribution.\n"
#| "            If sigma is omitted, it is estimated from sample, using "
#| "STDEV.\n"
#| "        "
msgid ""
"Performs a test of the null hypothesis, that sample is a sample of a normal "
"distributed random variable with mean mean and standard deviation sigma. A "
"return value of 1 indicates, that the null hypothesis is rejected, i.e. the "
"sample is not a random sample of the normal distribution. If sigma is "
"omitted, it is estimated from sample, using STDEV."
msgstr ""
"Föhrt en Prööv vun de Nullhypothees dör, dat Muster is en Muster\n"
"            vun en normaal verdeelt tofällig Variabel mit middelt "
"Middelweert un Standardverscheel \n"
"            (Sigma). En Torüchgaav-Weert vun 1 bedüüdt, dat de "
"Nullhypothees\n"
"            afwiest wöör, d.h., dat Muster is keen tofällig Muster vun\n"
"            de Normaalverdelen.\n"
"            Wenn Sigma utlaten warrt, denn warrt dat mit STDEV vun't Muster "
"estemeert.\n"
"        "

#. Tag: para
#: functions.docbook:9330
#, no-c-format
msgid "ZTEST(x; mean; standardDeviation)"
msgstr "ZTEST(x; Middel; Standardverscheel)"

#. Tag: seg
#: functions.docbook:9335
#, no-c-format
msgid "mean"
msgstr "Middelweert"

#. Tag: seg
#: functions.docbook:9336
#, no-c-format
msgid "standardDeviation"
msgstr "Standardverscheel"

